Feature: create account functionality for RedBus application

Scenario: validate create account functionality with data
Given user is on Rediff Homepage
When user clicks on "Create Account"
Then should navigate to the create account page


Scenario: Validate registration with valid data
Given the user is on the Rediffmail registration page
When the user enters their full name
And chooses a Rediffmail ID
And enters a password
And retypes the password
And selects their date of birth
And selects their gender
And selects their city
And enters their recovery email ID
And enters their mobile number
And enters the captcha text
And clicks on "Create my account"
Then the account should be successfully created


Scenario: Validate registration with missing mandatory fields
Given the user is on the Rediffmail registration page
When the user leaves the full name field empty
And tries to proceed with the registration
Then an error message should be displayed indicating that the full name is required